  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_type": "isnad",
      "arabic_text": "مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ يَحْيَى عَنْ أَحْمَدَ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَنْ مَرْوَكِ بْنِ عُبَيْدٍ مِثْلَهُ . عَلِيُّ بْنُ إِبْرَاهِيمَ عَنْ أَبِيهِ عَنِ النَّوْفَلِيِّ عَنِ السَّكُونِيِّ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) قَالَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Muhammad ibn Yahya, from Ahmad ibn Muhammad, from Maruk ibn Ubayd, similar to it. Ali ibn Ibrahim, from his father, from Al-Nawfali, from Al-Sakuni, from Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him), who said:"
      }
    }
  ,
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "مَنِ اقْتُصَّ مِنْهُ فَهُوَ قَتِيلُ الْقُرْآنِ .",
      "translations": {
        "en": "The one from whom retaliation is taken, he is the 'killed of the Quran'."
      }
    }
